# Supply-chain guard: never resolve a dependency version published less than
# 24 h ago (most malicious releases are pulled within the first hour). Our own
# scopes are exempt so fresh releases can be adopted right away. Requires
# pnpm >= 10.16.
#
# This lives here instead of pnpm-workspace.yaml on purpose: @rrlab/cli
# (through @vlandoss/clibuddy 0.7.1) treats any repo with a pnpm-workspace.yaml
# as a monorepo, and `rr tsc` then fails ("Invalid workspace patterns") or, with
# `packages: ["."]`, silently skips this package. Move it once clibuddy only
# treats the file as a workspace when it declares `packages`.
minimum-release-age=1440
minimum-release-age-exclude[]=@variablelab/*
minimum-release-age-exclude[]=@rrlab/*
